	(text "LED strips: ~300 LEDS --> 3 LEDS * 20mA* 300 QTY \n= 18A at worst\nMCU: 100-500 (avg 250) w/ Wifi\nTransistor LEDs: 80mA + 20mA (GPIO)\nBuzzer: ~20mA max\nRF reader: 30mA max\nOLED: 30mA max"
