	(text "Resistors before data output to allow LED drive\n20mA per output (GPIO)\n20-80mA\n\nLogic shifter not necessary for short wires, \nbut I want to allow room wide connections.\nAka, if I need a longer connection from this circuit \nto an LED wall, then I want that option."
